{"id":"type-monotonicity-inequality","html":"<section id=\"features\"><h2>题型特征</h2><ul><li><p>已知单调性，比较同一函数的两个输入所对应的函数值。</p></li></ul><div class=\"feature-confuse\"><p class=\"feature-tag\">别和它混淆</p><ul><li><span>原目标是求完整单调区间或证明增减，不是解函数值不等式。</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\">→</b><a class=\"node-chip\" data-kind=\"problem_type\" data-node-link href=\"/knowledge/type-function-monotonicity/\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\"></i>判断函数的单调性</a></li><li><span>原目标是借助单调性求最值或转化最值条件求参，不是解函数值不等式。</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\">→</b><a class=\"node-chip\" data-kind=\"problem_type\" data-node-link href=\"/knowledge/type-monotonicity-extremum/\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\"></i>利用单调性求最值</a></li></ul></div></section><section id=\"choose\"><h2>怎么选方法</h2><div class=\"choose-rule\"><p>用<a data-node-link href=\"/knowledge/rule-monotonicity-inequality-method/\">单调性不等式的选法判断</a>来选：满足哪一条，就可以用对应的方法；几条同时满足时，挑顺手的。</p><ul class=\"branch-list\"><li><span>同一函数的两个函数值比大小，且已有严格单调依据。</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\">→</b><a class=\"node-chip\" data-kind=\"method\" data-node-link href=\"/knowledge/method-monotonicity-inequality/\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\"></i>单调性解不等式法</a></li></ul></div><h3>可选用的方法</h3><div class=\"choose-methods\"><article class=\"choose-method\"><h4><a class=\"node-chip\" data-kind=\"method\" data-node-link href=\"/knowledge/method-monotonicity-inequality/\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\"></i>单调性解不等式法</a></h4><p class=\"choose-when\"><strong>适合什么题：</strong>同一函数的两个输入比较，以及题给或已证明的严格单调性。</p><p>检查两个输入落在同一严格单调区间，再按增减性把函数值比较转为输入比较，最后与合法域求交。</p></article></div></section><section id=\"examples\"><h2>说明与题例</h2><article class=\"example\"><h3>1. 已知递增解不等式</h3><p class=\"problem\">函数 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span> 的定义域为 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∞</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(0,+\\infty)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">+</span><span class=\"mord\">∞</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span> 且递增，解 <span class=\"math-tail\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f(2x)&lt;f(x+1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span>。</span></p><ol><li>两个输入都要大于 <span class=\"math-tail\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span>，</span>得 <span class=\"math-tail\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x&gt;0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span>。</span></li><li>递增保序，得 <span class=\"math-tail\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2x&lt;x+1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:0.6835em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span>，</span>即 <span class=\"math-tail\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x&lt;1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span>。</span></li><li>求交得 <span class=\"math-tail\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>∈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x\\in(0,1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span>。</span></li></ol><p class=\"source\">函数单调性 FM-T3</p></article></section>"}
